{"word":"βάμμα","uri":"bamma","senses":[{"word":"βάμμα","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">βάμμα,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ατος</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">τὸ</span>) liquide dans lequel une chose est\nplongée, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> teinture, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">956</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> la couleur que communique la teinture :\n<span class=\"grec\">β. Σαρδιανικόν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ach.</span> <span class=\"refch\">112,</span> teinture de Sardes, <span class=\"ital\">c. à\nd.</span> de pourpre, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de meurtrissures\nsanglantes</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> jus, sauce, <span class=\"aut\">Nic.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span> <span class=\"refch\">622,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span></div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">βάπτω</span>.</div>\n"}]}